---
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config/site';
---

<footer class="bg-[#F5F5F7] text-[#1D1D1F] border-t border-black/[0.08] pt-14 pb-12">
  <div class="max-w-[1240px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Top Footer Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-8 pb-10 border-b border-black/[0.06]">
      
      <!-- Brand & Tagline -->
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[#1D1D1F] font-bold text-[18px] mb-1.5">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-[#0071E3] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs">
            <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <span>{SITE_CONFIG.name}</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[13px] text-[#6E6E73]">
          更简单的全球网络连接体验。
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Footer Quick Navigation -->
      <nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 text-[13px] text-[#6E6E73]" aria-label="页脚导航">
        <a href="#" class="hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors">首页</a>
        <a href="#features" class="hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors">为什么选择我们</a>
        <a href="#nodes" class="hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors">全球节点</a>
        <a href="#pricing" class="hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors">套餐方案</a>
        <a href="#clients" class="hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors">客户端支持</a>
        <a href="#faq" class="hover:text-[#0071E3] transition-colors">常见问题</a>
        <a href={SITE_CONFIG.registerUrl} target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored noopener" class="text-[#0071E3] font-medium hover:underline">立即注册</a>
      </nav>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Disclaimer & Copyright -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[12px] text-[#6E6E73]">
      
      <p class="max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        免责声明：网络服务实际体验可能因用户所在地区、当地运营商、线路状态、设备及第三方平台政策而有所不同。请合理合规使用网络资源。
      </p>

      <div class="shrink-0 text-[#6E6E73]">
        © 2026 {SITE_CONFIG.name}. 保留所有权利。
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</footer>
